{% slide title="If you would like an example" align="center" hideNavigation=false %}
![slide_5_Freeform_7.png](@admin-assets/images/courses/6-6/slide_5_Freeform_7.png)

You can use an example or choose your own words.
- **Bus:**
- "AI could help me know when my bus arrives…"
- "…because I do not like to wait."
- **New places:**
- "AI could help me find my way in new places…"
- "…because I want to travel on my own."
{% /slide %}

